nal","quote":"亮南征，留邵为治中从事","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":321,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":40,"end":51},{"id":"dongliu-q-e2c33f6fff716105c8c6","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-4f59a98859b4f475164b","layer":"pei","quote":"建兴三年，亮征南中","attribution":"裴注·襄阳记","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-b2f83c142b53ed7a6593","start":11,"end":20},{"id":"dongliu-q-eb0b210fd16e9b4d714b","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-4f59a98859b4f475164b","layer":"pei","quote":"亮纳其策，赦孟获以服南方","attribution":"裴注·襄阳记","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-b2f83c142b53ed7a6593","start":163,"end":175},{"id":"houzhu-q-O005","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-79ab2e26e514bf6b9ab6","layer":"original","quote":"建兴元年夏〖3〗，牂牁太守朱褒拥郡反〖4〗。﹝二﹞先是，益州郡有大姓雍闿反〖5〗，流太守张裔于吴〖6〗，据郡不宾〖7〗；越嶲夷王高定亦背叛〖8〗。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":73},{"id":"houzhu-q-O011","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-354a0a35bf9887aa11d1","layer":"original","quote":"三年春三月，丞相亮南征四郡〖2〗，四郡皆平。改益州郡为建宁郡；分建宁、永昌郡为云南郡〖3〗；又分建宁、牂牁为兴古郡〖4〗。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":61},{"id":"houzhu-q-O012","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-3529bcb2e8097984bcb5","layer":"original","quote":"十二月，亮还成都。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":36,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":9},{"id":"houzhu-q-P009","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-53b96eb73d836c301397","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏氏春秋》曰：“初，益州从事常房行部；闻褒将有异志，收其主簿案问，杀之。褒怒，攻杀房，诬以谋反。诸葛亮诛房诸子，徙其四弟于越嶲，欲以安之。褒犹不悛改，遂以郡叛应雍闿。”臣松之按：以为房为褒所诬，执政所宜澄察；安有妄杀不辜，以悦奸慝？斯殆妄矣！","attribution":"裴注","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":33,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-44360c98af08576e4c14","start":0,"end":125},{"id":"houzhu-q-P009a","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-53b96eb73d836c301397","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏氏春秋》曰：“初，益州从事常房行部；闻褒将有异志，收其主簿案问，杀之。褒怒，攻杀房，诬以谋反。诸葛亮诛房诸子，徙其四弟于越嶲，欲以安之。褒犹不悛改，遂以郡叛应雍闿。”","attribution":"裴注·《魏氏春秋》","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":33,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-44360c98af08576e4c14","start":0,"end":88},{"id":"huangli-q-11650be20d7994ceabf5","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-073f8aa6e597cbc1398c","layer":"original","quote":"初，（建宁）〔益州〕郡杀太守正昂，缚太守张裔於吴","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":129,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24},{"id":"huangli-q-15bc1d2851ab73d91986","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-8de1f97850df61e22fd0","layer":"original","quote":"闿但答一纸曰：“盖闻天无二日，土无二王；今天下鼎立，正朔有三〖2〗；是以远人惶惑，不知所归也！”其桀慢如此","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":90,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":32,"end":85},{"id":"huangli-q-3076eb64caa60a3cd72c","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-e11f9e586959d73e2f0d","layer":"original","quote":"高定恣睢於越嶲","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":4,"end":11},{"id":"huangli-q-41212503d95639eed507","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-8de1f97850df61e22fd0","layer":"original","quote":"闿又降於吴，吴遥署闿为永昌太守","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":90,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":86,"end":101},{"id":"huangli-q-43a5e313e1c23bb63d00","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-1f594d574238f76d3965","layer":"original","quote":"亮至南，上表曰：“永昌郡吏吕凯、府丞王伉等，执忠绝域〖26〗，十有余年；雍闿、高定逼其东北，而凯等守义不与交通。臣不意永昌风俗敦直乃尔","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":93,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":43,"end":110},{"id":"huangli-q-4639de401721810ce6f4","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-e11f9e586959d73e2f0d","layer":"original","quote":"于是恢出击，大破之；追奔逐北，南至盘江〖19〗，东接牂牁，与亮声势相连","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":170,"end":205},{"id":"huangli-q-4fa98566de987fcf2019","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-fe752448b5205d5377fb","layer":"original","quote":"闿数移檄永昌，称说云云","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":91,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":46,"end":57},{"id":"huangli-q-6468462c5c9ba31b69b4","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-e11f9e586959d73e2f0d","layer":"original","quote":"丞相亮南征，先由越嶲","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":32,"end":42},{"id":"huangli-q-694dff6b5d17f718e768","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-eeece5f7b734fad61b54","layer":"original","quote":"郡丞朱褒反","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":127,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":41,"end":46},{"id":"huangli-q-719f26aa2be89e5fdfc4","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-1f594d574238f76d3965","layer":"original","quote":"及丞相亮南征讨阉，既发在道","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":93,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":18,"end":31},{"id":"huangli-q-82cef6099d615e3317fb","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-e11f9e586959d73e2f0d","layer":"original","quote":"雍闿跋扈於建宁","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":16,"end":23},{"id":"huangli-q-852710da71abfbba696b","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-8de1f97850df61e22fd0","layer":"original","quote":"都护李严与闿书六纸，解喻利害","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":90,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":17,"end":31},{"id":"huangli-q-8607804c6bf08d8f9001","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-1f594d574238f76d3965","layer":"original","quote":"而闿已为高定部曲所杀","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":93,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":32,"end":42},{"id":"huangli-q-a26e1b325e226f8b0462","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-49be78af6ec4af5079d0","layer":"original","quote":"凯答檄曰：“天降丧乱〖4〗，奸雄乘衅〖5〗；天下切齿，万国悲悼；臣妾大小，莫不思竭筋力；肝脑涂地，以除国难。伏惟将军世受汉恩，以为当躬聚党众，率先启行；上以报国家，下不负先人；书功竹帛，遗名千载。何期臣仆吴越〖6〗，背本就末乎！昔舜勤民事，陨于苍梧〖7〗；书籍嘉之，流声无穷〖8〗。崩于江浦〖9〗，何足可悲！文、武受命〖10〗，成王乃平〖11〗。先帝龙兴，海内望风；宰臣聪睿，自天降康。而将军不睹盛衰之纪〖12〗，成败之符〖13〗；譬如野火在原，蹈履河冰；火灭冰泮〖14〗，将何所依附？曩者将军先君雍侯〖15〗，造怨而封；窦融知兴〖16〗，归志世祖〖17〗：皆流名后叶，世歌其美。今诸葛丞相英才挺出，深睹未萌〖18〗；受遗托孤，翊赞季兴〖19〗；与众无忌，录功忘瑕〖20〗。将军若能翻然改图，易迹更步；古人不难追，鄙土何足宰哉〖21〗？盖闻楚国不恭〖22〗，齐桓是责；夫差僭号〖23〗，晋人不长〖24〗；况臣于非主，谁肯归之邪？窃惟古义，臣无越境之交，是以前后有来无往。重承告示〖25〗，发愤忘食；故略陈所怀，惟将军察焉","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":92,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":460},{"id":"huangli-q-b5114bce442112fd9e76","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-e11f9e586959d73e2f0d","layer":"original","quote":"时恢众少敌倍，又未得亮声息，绐谓南人曰〖15〗：“官军粮尽，欲规退还〖16〗；吾中间久斥乡里〖17〗，乃今得旋〖18〗，不能复北；欲还与汝等同计谋，故以诚相告。”南人信之，故围守怠缓","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":78,"end":169},{"id":"huangli-q-d6880fb35d8a8e416986","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-e11f9e586959d73e2f0d","layer":"original","quote":"朱褒反叛于牂牁","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":24,"end":31},{"id":"huangli-q-e1483ff918bac0db8db5","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-8de1f97850df61e22fd0","layer":"original","quote":"时雍闿等闻先主薨于永安，骄黠滋甚","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":90,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16},{"id":"huangli-q-e3ccf28eaf60b6787884","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-e11f9e586959d73e2f0d","layer":"original","quote":"而恢案道向建宁〖13〗，诸县大相纠合，围恢军于昆（明）〔泽〕","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":43,"end":73},{"id":"huangli-q2-6254044d8d3612c9cdf7","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-1f594d574238f76d3965","layer":"original","quote":"凯威恩内著，为郡中所信，故能全其节。及丞相亮南征讨阉，既发在道，而闿已为高定部曲所杀。亮至南，上表曰：“永昌郡吏吕凯、府丞王伉等，执忠绝域〖26〗，十有余年；雍闿、高定逼其东北，而凯等守义不与交通。臣不意永昌风俗敦直乃尔！”","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":93,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":112},{"id":"huowang-q-3b408563cd6173927bbe","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-e549715bb9d87cafdb54","layer":"original","quote":"耆率雍闿恩信著于南土〖12〗，使命周旋〖13〗，远通孙权","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":69,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":12,"end":40},{"id":"huowang-q-8f424ee850969da203c7","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-5008b9b7cd23cd6b1641","layer":"original","quote":"丞相亮南征，朗留统后事","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":20,"end":31},{"id":"huowang-q-9418f38e1a330c9a23fd","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-0331bba35be1e9a1beba","layer":"original","quote":"建兴三年，随诸葛亮南行，归至汉阳县","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":172,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":17},{"id":"huowang-q-cbe63f868ee6f440b5c7","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-e549715bb9d87cafdb54","layer":"original","quote":"益州郡杀太守正昂","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":69,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":3,"end":11},{"id":"huowang-q-f2aa0de3bebd591eb69b","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-e549715bb9d87cafdb54","layer":"original","quote":"闿遂趦趄不宾〖14〗，假鬼教曰〖15〗：“张府君如瓠壶〖16〗，外虽泽而内实粗〖17〗；不足杀〖18〗，令缚与吴。”于是遂送裔于权","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":69,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":55,"end":120},{"id":"liuermu-q-74c22b7e2a9d68bbb6e6","section":"chapter-031","block":"b-2a7eb34fd683676ae1b4","layer":"original","quote":"丞相诸葛亮平南土","section_title":"刘二牧传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0068.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":41,"end":49},{"id":"liuermu-q-a9f48e45367138fd4bf2","section":"chapter-031","block":"b-2a7eb34fd683676ae1b4","layer":"original","quote":"南中豪率雍闿据益郡反〖31〗，附于吴","section_title":"刘二牧传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0068.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":3,"end":21},{"id":"wendi-q-b-94d58550e3abb558ad13","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-94d58550e3abb558ad13","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：黄初四年（公元 223）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":394,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2950ca88709b8c25fb44","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wendi-q-o038","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-62c39b4b73d5f8874468","layer":"original","quote":"四年春正月〖1〗，诏曰：“丧乱以来，兵革未戢〖2〗。天下之人，互相残杀。今海内初定，敢有私复仇者，皆族之〖3〗！”筑南巡台于宛。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":391,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":64},{"id":"yaoci-q-4ffb0440cddc892a4427","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-bf1005b55c03c54ff480","layer":"original","quote":"燮又诱导益州豪姓雍闿等〖9〗，率郡人民使遥东附，权益嘉之","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":215,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":37,"end":65},{"id":"zhanggu-q-67c2af61b00b696d13a9","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-329ec2ae8393bab5504c","layer":"original","quote":"益州大姓雍闿等，杀蜀所署太守正昂〖10〗；与燮相闻，求欲内附，骘因承制遣使宣恩抚纳〖11〗。由是加拜平戎将军〖12〗，封广信侯","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":358,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":63},{"id":"zhuge-e-o022b-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-cdc51ff4fdbd6022c499","layer":"original","quote":"南中诸郡，并皆叛乱。亮以新遭大丧，故未便加兵；且遣使聘吴，因结和亲〖8〗，遂为与国〖9〗。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":132,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":42,"end":87},{"id":"zhuge-e-o023a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-862592827af5abe9feb3","layer":"original","quote":"三年春〖10〗，亮率众南征〖11〗。﹝三﹞其秋，悉平：军资所出〖12〗，国以富饶；﹝四﹞乃治戎讲武，以俟大举。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":133,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-28bd067e0a3e898385bc","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-28bd067e0a3e898385bc","layer":"modern","quote":"〖10〗三年：建兴三年（公元 225）。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":144,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-d52302c7e46aff00f085","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"zhuge-q-o021","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-6f9ad1f5d575a9d3f55f","layer":"original","quote":"章武三年春，先主于永安病笃〖1〗；召亮于成都，属以后事。谓亮曰：“君才十倍曹丕，必能安国，终定大事。若嗣子可辅，辅之；如其不才〖2〗，君可自取〖3〗。”亮涕泣曰：“臣敢竭股肱之力〖4〗，效忠贞之节，继之以死！”先主又为诏敕后主曰：“汝与丞相从事〖5〗，事之如父。”﹝一﹞","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":131,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":135},{"id":"zhuge-q-o023","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-862592827af5abe9feb3","layer":"original","quote":"三年春〖10〗，亮率众南征〖11〗。﹝三﹞其秋，悉平：军资所出〖12〗，国以富饶；﹝四﹞乃治戎讲武，以俟大举。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":133,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
